    },
    {
      "displayText": "제게 있어서\n최고이자 최강의 포켓몬은...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC8C0020C788C5B4C11C000ACD5CACE0C774C7900020CD5CAC15C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC740002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "딱충이예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B531CDA9C774C608C6940021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 최강의 딱충이 전문가를 목표로\n수행 중이에요! 그러니 저와 상대해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020CD5CAC15C7580020B531CDA9C7740020C804BB38AC00B97C0020BAA9D45CB85C000AC218D5890020C911C774C5D0C69400210020ADF8B7ECB2C80020C800C6400020C0C1B300D5740020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부할 준비가 되셨다면\n말을 걸어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80D5600020C900BE44AC000020B418C168B2E4BA74000AB9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 딱충이들을 봐 주세요!\n승부할 준비는 되셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020B531CDA9C774B4E4C7440020BD100020C8FCC138C6940021000AC2B9BD80D5600020C900BE44B2940020B418C168B098C694003F001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "됐어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B410C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빨리 딱충이를 보여 주고 싶은데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE68B9AC0020B531CDA9C774B97C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCACE00020C2F6C740B370002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CCC6940021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 딱충이들을 보여 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020B531CDA9C774B4E4C7440020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강한 트레이너시네요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n제 딱충이들에게도\n좋은 경험이 된 것 같아요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D55C0020D2B8B808C774B108C2DCB124C694002E00100001BE01000AC81C0020B531CDA9C774B4E4C5D0AC8CB3C4000AC88BC7400020ACBDD5D8C7740020B41C0020AC830020AC19C544C694002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아!\n경험치를 얻으면 안 되는데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5440021000AACBDD5D8CE58B97C0020C5BBC73CBA740020C5480020B418B294B370002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "딱충이가...\n독침붕으로 진화해 버렸어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B531CDA9C774AC00002E002E002E000AB3C5CE68BD95C73CB85C0020C9C4D654D5740020BC84B838C5B4C694002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이러다\n딱충이 전문가가 아니라...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7ECB2E4000AB531CDA9C7740020C804BB38AC00AC000020C544B2C8B77C002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "독침붕 전문가가 되어 버리면 어쩌지!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C5CE68BD950020C804BB38AC00AC000020B418C5B40020BC84B9ACBA740020C5B4CA4CC9C00021003F001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래도 괜찮아요!\n벌레포켓몬은 진화가 빠르니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798B3C40020AD1CCC2EC544C6940021000ABC8CB808D3ECCF13BAACC7400020C9C4D654AC000020BE60B974B2C8AE4CC694002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니 딱충이로 지내는\n짧은 시간을 소중히 여길 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C80020B531CDA9C774B85C0020C9C0B0B4B294000AC9E7C7400020C2DCAC04C7440020C18CC911D7880020C5ECAE380020AC70C608C694002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보통은 스스로 진화하지 않는데...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4D1B5C7400020C2A4C2A4B85C0020C9C4D654D558C9C00020C54AB294B370002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네? 보통은 지닌 포켓몬에서 ‘진화한다’를\n선택하기 전에는 진화하지 않는다구요?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n제 딱충이는 엄청 특별한 딱충이인 걸까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋은데요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n...딱충이도 좋지만\n독침붕도 좋거든요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n아~ 진화는 정말 고민되는 문제예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC740B370C694002100100001BE01000A002E002E002EB531CDA9C774B3C40020C88BC9C0B9CC000AB3C5CE68BD95B3C40020C88BAC70B4E0C694002E00100001BE00000AC544007E0020C9C4D654B2940020C815B9D00020ACE0BBFCB418B2940020BB38C81CC608C6940021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
